[h1]R.A.T.S. Rigging[/h1]
[i]R.A.T.S. – Reconnaissance, Acoustics, Terrain & Signals[/i]

[b]The shared add-on of the R.A.T.S. mods.[/b]
It holds the code the R.A.T.S. mods have in common. Not a mod to play: it adds nothing to the game by itself.

[quote]💬 [b]Questions, help, ideas[/b]: [url=https://discord.gg/CzuHd4f8Yf]R.A.T.S. Discord[/url], the first place to ask
▶ [b]Requires[/b]: [b]R.A.T.S. Keel[/b], the mod loader (Required items, top right)
✉ Bug reports: [url=https://hub.sewerlabs.dev/s/rigging]R.A.T.S. feedback board[/url]
⭐ A favourite helps other captains find it[/quote]

[h2]▶ Quick start[/h2]
[list]
[*]Subscribe, or do nothing: it comes as a required item with the R.A.T.S. mods. Switch it on in Mods
[*][b]Loaded?[/b] Keel's report (Ctrl+Shift+K) lists R.A.T.S. Rigging as running
[*][b]Already have R.A.T.S. mods?[/b] They carry a copy for now, so nothing breaks; a notice on the main menu offers this item
[/list]

[h2]⚠ Good to know[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Nothing changes for you:[/b] your settings, hotkeys, logs and saves stay as they are
[*][b]Later the copies leave the mods.[/b] Then a mod needs this item to start; Keel's card says so and has a Get it button
[/list]

[h2]⚙ Install and game versions[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Game:[/b] 0.9.3 (build 261116), the current main version; 0.8.7 is not supported
[*][b]R.A.T.S. Keel:[/b] https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3835527459
[*]Source: https://github.com/struckl/SeaPowerRigging (R.A.T.S. Source License: read and fork, no re-uploads)
[/list]

[h2]⚙ For mod makers[/h2]
[list]
[*]Name it as a dependency ([ACDependency]): the loader starts it first and keeps your mod out, with the reason, when it is missing. Only grows, so older builds keep working
[*][url=https://github.com/struckl/SeaPowerRigging/blob/main/docs/api.md]The API[/url] · [url=https://github.com/struckl/SeaPowerRigging/blob/main/docs/building.md]Building a mod on it[/url]
[/list]

[h2]✉ Problems, feedback, ideas[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://discord.gg/CzuHd4f8Yf]R.A.T.S. Discord[/url]: questions, help and ideas, the first place to ask
[*][url=https://hub.sewerlabs.dev/s/rigging]R.A.T.S. feedback board[/url] for bug reports, or Send report in Keel's report window
[/list]

[h2]Support[/h2]
[list]
[*]All R.A.T.S. mods are free and stay free. If you want to keep the rats fed: [url=https://ko-fi.com/kanalratte_sewerlabs]a cheese on Ko-fi[/url] or [url=https://www.patreon.com/cw/Kanalratte]Patreon[/url]
[/list]

[i]R.A.T.S. – Ratte's Assorted Tactical Systems[/i]
